[%# The keys the runner authorizes on every guest it builds, one per line, in
    the format sshd reads.

    Inherited from the keys this guest was built with unless the domain named
    its own: a runner administers what it builds the way this installation
    administers it.  Held as a file rather than as an identity for cloud-init to
    resolve, which is why there is a template for it at all.

    No apostrophes in an Xslate comment: the lexer reads one as opening a
    string and swallows the template as far as the next quote. -%]
[% FOR key IN config.admin_keys -%]
[% key %]
[% END -%]
